      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid pb-5 hero-header hero-home\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"hero-glass row g-3 align-items-center p-4 p-lg-5 mx-0\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 text-center text-lg-start\">\n                    <h1 class=\"display-4 mb-0 animated slideInLeft\">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 animated slideInRight\">\n                    <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n                        <ol class=\"breadcrumb justify-content-center justify-content-lg-end mb-0\">\n                            <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"/index.html\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"breadcrumb-item text-secondary active\" aria-current=\"page\">FAQs</li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container py-5\">\n        <div class=\"post-layout\">\n            <p class=\"lead-answer\">Answers to the questions we hear most often about how a project with The Omega Group actually works — from your first consultation through to what happens after handover. Looking for cost figures or service-specific details instead? See our <a href=\"/interior-designers-gurgaon/\">Gurgaon service area guide</a>, our <a href=\"/service.html\">Services</a> page, or the cost breakdowns on our <a href=\"/blog.html\">blog</a>.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"post-faq mt-0\" data-faq-schema>\n                <div class=\"accordion\" id=\"faq-hub\">\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-0\">\n                                How do I start a project with The Omega Group?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-0\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Book a complimentary consultation through our <a href=\"/contact.html\">Contact page</a> or call us directly. We'll discuss your space, lifestyle, budget, and timeline, then follow up with a design direction and scope before any commercial terms are finalized.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-1\">\n                                Is the first consultation really free?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-1\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Yes — the initial consultation, where we understand your space and requirements, doesn't cost anything. Detailed design work and execution are scoped and quoted separately once we understand your project.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-2\">\n                                Do I need to be based in Gurgaon to work with you?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-2\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">No — while we're headquartered on Dwarka Expressway and most of our projects are across Gurgaon, we also take on projects elsewhere in Delhi NCR. Mention your location when you reach out and we'll confirm feasibility.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-3\">\n                                Is there a minimum project size?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-3\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">No fixed minimum — we take on everything from a single modular kitchen or bespoke furniture piece to a full villa. Full-home turnkey interior design starts at ₹15 Lakhs+, scaling with size and customization.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-4\">\n                                How are payments structured?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-4\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Payments are milestone-based, tied to project stages (design sign-off, material procurement, execution phases, and handover) rather than one lump sum. Your exact payment schedule is confirmed in writing before work begins, so there are no surprises. See our <a href=\"/cost-planning-guides/interior-design-payment-schedule-gurgaon/\">interior design payment schedule</a> guide for a full stage-by-stage breakdown.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-5\">\n                                Do you handle society/RWA approvals and NOCs?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-5\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Yes, where required — we coordinate with your society or RWA on renovation NOCs, material delivery windows, and work-hour restrictions, which is one of the reasons a locally based team matters for Gurgaon high-rises.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-6\">\n                                Can I make changes once execution has started?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-6\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Minor changes are usually possible, though changes after material procurement or civil work has begun can affect cost and timeline. We'll always tell you the impact of a change before confirming it, rather than applying it silently.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-7\">\n                                Do you work alongside an architect or builder we've already hired?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-7\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Yes — we regularly coordinate with architects, builders, and civil contractors already engaged on a property, handling the interior design and execution layer within their structural and timeline constraints.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-8\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-8\">\n                                What happens if a project runs behind schedule?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-8\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">We complete 90% of projects on schedule, but where a delay does happen (material lead times are the most common cause), we flag it as soon as we know and communicate a revised date — you're never left guessing.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-9\">\n                                Can I see material samples before finalizing my design?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-9\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Yes — finishes, hardware, and countertop materials are reviewed with you as physical samples or detailed specification sheets before we place any order, so there are no surprises at installation.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-10\">\n                                Do you offer support after handover?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-10\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Yes — hardware and modular components carry manufacturer-backed warranties, and our team remains reachable for post-handover questions or adjustments. See our blog for maintenance guidance on specific materials, like our <a href=\"/blog/modular-kitchen-designer-gurgaon-renovation-guide/\">kitchen renovation guide</a>, or our guide on whether you need an <a href=\"/home-residential-interiors/interior-design-amc-annual-maintenance-contract/\">annual maintenance contract (AMC)</a> after handover.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n                        <h3 class=\"accordion-header\">\n                            <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#faq-hub-11\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-hub-11\">\n                                What's the difference between your design service and turnkey execution?\n                            </button>\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"faq-hub-11\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faq-hub\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-body\">Design-only means we hand you drawings and specifications to execute with your own contractor. Turnkey means our own team also procures materials and executes the build — the option most of our clients choose, since it keeps one team accountable for the entire outcome.</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"post-links-block\">\n                <h2>Still Have a Question?</h2>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"/contact.html\">Book a free consultation</a> and ask us directly.</li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/service.html\">See the full range of services we offer.</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/blog.html\">Browse our blog</a> for detailed cost and process guides.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    }
  ],
